        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "三寸高，内中方圆交佐巳孔如田字格样。好下药。此是杉木板片合进，切忌杂木夹半式。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
